{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "866e07d3-8642-46ee-89af-a8d715339990",
    "name": "BLUE V1 - Customer Authentication, Profile & Reference Data",
    "description": "BLUE V1 customer authentication endpoints, generated from the actual implementation in backend/routes/api.php, backend/app/Http/Controllers/Api/V1/Auth, backend/app/Actions/Auth, and verified against backend/tests/Feature/Auth. See docs/api-contracts/authentication-v1.md for the full written contract.\n\nNo SMS delivery integration exists yet, so OTP codes are never returned by any endpoint. BLUE stores only a one-way hash of each OTP (code_hash) - the raw code cannot be recovered from the database. Set otp_code manually in the environment after obtaining the raw OTP from the future SMS delivery / development delivery mechanism once implemented. Never add a debug endpoint or any other channel to expose OTP codes.\n\nAlso includes the public registration/edit-profile reference-data endpoint and the authenticated customer profile endpoints (GET/PATCH /v1/profile), documented in docs/api-contracts/profile-and-reference-data-v1.md.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Registration",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"Layla Hassan\",\n  \"phone_number\": \"{{phone_number}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"city_id\": 1,\n  \"area_id\": 1,\n  \"property_relationship_type_id\": 1,\n  \"service_interests\": [1, 2]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Creates the customer account (PENDING_VERIFICATION) and issues a PHONE_VERIFICATION OTP. Requires valid, active city_id/area_id/property_relationship_type_id/service_interests reference IDs seeded in the target environment."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 201', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('success is true', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.otp_verification_uuid) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('otp_verification_uuid', json.data.otp_verification_uuid);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Phone Verification",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Verify Phone OTP",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"otp_verification_uuid\": \"{{otp_verification_uuid}}\",\n  \"otp_code\": \"{{otp_code}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/verify-phone",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "verify-phone"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Verifies the PHONE_VERIFICATION OTP issued by Register or Resend Phone OTP, and activates the account. Only a hash of the OTP is stored server-side, so the raw code cannot be read from the database; otp_code must be obtained from the future SMS delivery / development delivery mechanism, never from an API response."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('success is true', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().success).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend Phone OTP",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"otp_verification_uuid\": \"{{otp_verification_uuid}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/resend-otp",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "resend-otp"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Reissues a PHONE_VERIFICATION OTP, subject to a 60-second cooldown. The returned otp_verification_uuid replaces the previous one."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('success is true', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (json.data && json.data.otp_verification_uuid) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('otp_verification_uuid', json.data.otp_verification_uuid);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
